01:11:10,588 --> 01:11:16,588
The Stars Look Down is a British film from 1940, based on A.

12
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
Cronin's 1935 novel of the same title, about injustices
in a mining town in North East England.

13
01:24:07,058 --> 01:24:13,058
The film, co-scripted by Cronin and directed by Carol Reed, stars Michael
Redgrave as Davey Fenwick and Margaret Lockwood as Jenny Sunley.

14
